---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Structured Business Analysis.">
  <section class="page-shell about-page" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <p class="home-eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 id="about-heading">A student-led business analysis project</h1>
      <p>Structured Business Analysis is a V1 editorial system for learning how companies compete, grow, price, and build power.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        The project exists to make business cases more structured than a normal blog post. Each case is organized around a central question, source evidence, a serious counterargument, and a judgement that can be revised as better evidence appears.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is not a company, research institution, or finished publication network. It is an early student-led platform being built carefully, with public cases separated from local drafts.
      </p>
      <p>
        The long-term direction is a curated library of business analysis that is readable for students and serious enough for readers who want the reasoning behind a conclusion.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
